note 17_sum_of_digits.vss — Sum of Digits
task sum_digits needs n
    make sum becomes 0
    make temp becomes n
    during temp above 0
        sum becomes sum + (temp % 10)
        temp becomes math.floor(temp / 10)
    finish
    send sum
finish

say "Sum of digits of 4567: " + sum_digits(4567)
say "Sum of digits of 999: " + sum_digits(999)
